:''Not to be confused with [[Gabriel]].''
'''Detective Vigler''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]] loses [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] target but gains [[Strong Against|Strong]] & guaranteed [[Freeze|Freeze]] against [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]], plus a shorter attack animation and time between attacks. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] decreases foreswing and attack rate, increases health, speed, Wave level and backswing, and grants [[Sage Slayer]] and [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

